# ── NEVER COMMIT THESE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The service-account key is uploaded to Render as a Secret File, by hand,
# in the dashboard. It must never enter this repository — a key that has been
# pushed to GitHub is compromised even if the repo is private and even if you
# delete the commit afterwards, because it stays in the history.
firebase_service_account.json
serviceAccountKey.json
*.json.key
.env
*.env

# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
SECRET.txt
